==============================================================================
Bliss rendering stack (extracted)
==============================================================================

The Bliss rendering stack (bliss, bliss-dom, bliss-html, bliss-net,
bliss-paint, bliss-shell, bliss-traits, stylo_taffy, accesskit_xplat,
anyrender_vello) — a hard fork of Blitz by Dioxus Labs, and for
anyrender_vello also of DioxusLabs/anyrender — was extracted to its own
repository, https://github.com/nixpt/bliss-engine, published to crates.io
at 0.3.0 (BLISS-HOME-1/2, s506). That repository carries the full history
and upstream attribution (Blitz, the Masonry-derived checkbox tick in
bliss-paint, anyrender_vello) in its own NOTICE.

==============================================================================
Tornado TUI crates (extracted)
==============================================================================

The `tornado`/`tornado-*` TUI toolkit crates were extracted to their own
repository and renamed `tui-easy`: https://github.com/nixpt/tui-easy
(carries the full history and upstream attribution for these crates).
